{
  "id": "dns",
  "title": "Configuração via DNS",
  "parent": "tv_lg",
  "description": "Tutorial definitivo de configuração de DNS para Smart TVs LG e Samsung.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10 animate-fadeIn'><div class='bg-indigo-600/10 border-l-4 border-indigo-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-network-wired'></i> Método de Instalação via DNS</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>Siga o vídeo e o passo a passo abaixo para configurar sua TV em menos de 2 minutos.</p></div><div class='aspect-video rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-gray-800 bg-black mb-10'><video class='w-full h-full' controls poster='/shared_assets/logo/ico-suporte.png'><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/alterar-dns-lg-antiga.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Configurações de Rede</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Pressione o botão <b>Settings</b> no controle, vá em <b>Rede</b> e selecione <b>Conexão de Rede Wi-Fi</b> (ou cabo).</p></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Alterar Servidor DNS</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Vá em <b>Configurações Avançadas</b>, mude o DNS para <b>Manual</b> e digite:</p><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-blue-500/30 p-6 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-xl mb-6'><p class='text-[10px] text-blue-400 font-black uppercase mb-2'>DNS Principal</p><h2 class='text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter'>45.139.122.240</h2></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Aplicativo Gatilho</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Com o DNS configurado, basta abrir o aplicativo <b>LOOKE</b> ou <b>SMARTUP</b> na sua TV para acessar nosso portal.</p><div class='grid grid-cols-2 gap-4'><div class='bg-black/20 border border-gray-800 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-looke.webp' class='h-10 mx-auto mb-2'><p class='text-[10px] font-black text-white uppercase'>Looke</p></div><div class='bg-black/20 border border-gray-800 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-smartup.jpg' class='h-10 mx-auto mb-2'><p class='text-[10px] font-black text-white uppercase'>SmartUp</p></div></div></section></div>"
  }
}
